    "A Menu must contain at least one Slot.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "菜单必须至少包含一个槽位。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A credential must be one line of at most 4096 characters.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "凭据必须是不超过 4096 个字符的一行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A credential must have a valid reference and one line of at most 4096 characters.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "凭据必须有有效的引用，且为不超过 4096 个字符的一行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A mouse-first macOS action environment centered on a radial Menu.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以环形菜单为中心、鼠标优先的 macOS 动作环境。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关于"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accent Colour": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "强调色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Access applies Plugin-wide. Commands requiring denied access remain unavailable; optional access is skipped when not granted. Menu Items are preserved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "访问权限作用于整个插件。需要被拒访问权限的命令保持不可用；未授予的可选访问权限会被跳过。菜单项会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Access revoked; %@ window closed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "访问权限已撤销；%@ 窗口已关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accessibility": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "辅助功能"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accessibility enables mouse triggers and protected keyboard recording": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "辅助功能用于鼠标触发键和受保护的键盘录制"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accessibility granted": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已授予辅助功能"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accessibility is recommended for mouse triggers, selected text, Paste, and Cut. You can skip and use permission-free Commands. Input Monitoring is not requested. Screen Recording and app-specific Automation are deferred until an explicit feature action.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "建议为鼠标触发键、所选文本、粘贴和剪切授予辅助功能权限。你也可以跳过并使用无需权限的命令。Spinnet 不请求输入监控。屏幕录制和针对特定 App 的自动化要等到你明确使用相关功能时才请求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accessibility lets Spinnet see the mouse trigger and work with selected text. Screen Recording is needed only for screenshots.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“辅助功能”让 Spinnet 能识别鼠标触发键并处理所选文本。只有截屏才需要“屏幕录制”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accessibility status": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "辅助功能状态"
