            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要批准"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Approve Spinnet…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "批准 Spinnet…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apps without a bundle identifier cannot be added.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法添加没有 Bundle 标识符的 App。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask Spinnet to close the front window of, quit or force quit the App in front, or one the Plugin identified. Close and Quit are the App's own ⌘W and ⌘Q, so it may ask you to save first, and only Apps whose menus offer them can be closed or quit that way. Spinnet names the App and asks you before a force quit, or before closing or quitting an App that is not in front; it never closes or quits Spinnet or parts of macOS.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请求 Spinnet 关闭前台 App 或插件识别的 App 的最前面窗口、退出或强制退出该 App。关闭和退出就是 App 自身的 ⌘W 和 ⌘Q，因此它可能会先请你存储，并且只有菜单中提供这些命令的 App 才能这样关闭或退出。强制退出之前，或关闭、退出不在前台的 App 之前，Spinnet 会写明该 App 并征求你的同意；它永远不会关闭或退出 Spinnet 或 macOS 的组成部分。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask the Host to take a screenshot of an area, the full screen, or a window, then copy it or save it to a folder you chose for the Menu Item. The Plugin never receives the image.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请求宿主截取一个区域、整个屏幕或一个窗口，然后拷贝截屏或将其存储到你为该菜单项选择的文件夹。插件永远不会收到图像。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Attempting to stop running Homebrew Tasks. Stopping does not undo package changes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在尝试停止运行中的 Homebrew 任务。停止不会撤销软件包更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
