    "Homebrew Services": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Homebrew 服务"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Homebrew Work Is Still Running": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Homebrew 工作仍在运行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Homebrew may quit the affected App first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Homebrew 可能会先退出受影响的 App。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Homebrew runs with your account and manages its own installers and scripts. Cask changes first try system Touch ID when available and configured for sudo. If sudo still needs your login password, Spinnet will ask for it in a separate password window. It is passed to sudo and is never shared with the Plugin or saved by Spinnet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Homebrew 以你的账户运行，并管理其自身的安装器和脚本。Cask 更改会先尝试使用系统触控 ID（如果可用且已为 sudo 配置）。如果 sudo 仍需要你的登录密码，Spinnet 会在单独的密码窗口中向你询问。密码会传给 sudo，绝不会与插件共享，也不会由 Spinnet 存储。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Homebrew will %@ %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Homebrew 将执行“%1$@”：%2$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Homebrew will uninstall formulae installed only as dependencies that are no longer needed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Homebrew 将卸载仅作为依赖项安装且已不再需要的 formula。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Homebrew will update Homebrew itself, all configured taps and package catalogs. This is a global change even when requested from one package. Later package actions reload metadata and recheck source trust. Stopping does not undo an update already applied.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Homebrew 将更新 Homebrew 本身、所有已配置的 tap 和软件包目录。即使是从某一个软件包发起，这也是全局更改。之后的软件包操作会重新载入元数据并重新检查来源信任。停止不会撤销已应用的更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Host": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "宿主"
          }
        }
      }
