    "Manage access separately. Permission changes take effect immediately; Save and Cancel apply only to Plugin Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "访问权限单独管理。权限更改立即生效；“存储”和“取消”只作用于插件设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Manage packages, taps and user-owned services through reviewed tasks. Package changes require Host confirmation; a separately declared automatic catalog refresh runs when entering Plugin pages and updates Homebrew itself and configured catalogs. Tasks continue after the view closes, prevent idle system sleep and can be stopped without rollback.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过已审核的任务管理软件包、tap 和用户拥有的服务。软件包更改需要宿主确认；单独声明的自动目录刷新会在进入插件页面时运行，并更新 Homebrew 本身和已配置的目录。任务在视图关闭后继续运行，会阻止系统闲置睡眠，并可在不回滚的情况下停止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
