    "What %@ keeps for itself between runs. Removing the Plugin deletes it; an update keeps it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 在多次运行之间为自己保存的内容。移除插件会删除它；更新会保留它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, hold the mouse trigger, drag to a Menu Item, and release to run it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用后，按住鼠标触发键，拖移到菜单项上，松开即可运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When off, the Status Item appears for ongoing Tasks and Effects, and for ended Tasks until cleared. Open Spinnet again to show Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭后，任务或效果进行时仍会显示菜单栏图标；已结束的任务在清除前也会让菜单栏图标保持显示。再次打开 Spinnet 可显示设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
